+### 4.3 list_sessions
+
+Requests conversation summaries for the user authenticated on this WebSocket connection. The
+server takes the user identity from the connection and ignores any `userId` field in the frame
+([validated by: answers list_sessions for the authenticated user with ISO dates, forwarding limit and before while ignoring any client userId](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L91)).
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_sessions",
+  "limit": 10,
