+### 5.9 session_list
+
+The server answers a `list_sessions` request with one `session_list` frame. Each session summary
+contains metadata only — `sessionId`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, and `entryCount` — and the two
+dates are ISO-8601 strings ([validated by: answers list_sessions for the authenticated user with ISO dates, forwarding limit and before while ignoring any client userId](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L91)).
