+`SERVER_ERROR` ([validated by: answers an empty session_list when the store has no listFor, and SERVER_ERROR with a ws error log when listFor throws](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L132)).
+
+**GDPR.** A `session_list` carries one authenticated user's conversation metadata and no
+conversation content. The user id comes from the connection, never from the frame. Enabling
+conversation history is a deployer's explicit decision, separate from resume; a client can
+reconnect with a returned `sessionId` to use the existing ownership check and replay path.
